hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1506","[AI-translation] Shuraid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aik din Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechay sawaar hua, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tujhe Umayya bin Abu Salt ke kuch shair yaad hain? Main ne kaha ji haan. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke parh. Main ne aik bait parha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke aur parh. Main ne aik aur parha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke aur parh, yahan tak ke main ne sau abyaat parhay. (Muslim: 7/48). Baab: Shair ka sab se sacha kalima. (Heeh se murad aur parh hai.)"
"1507","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Shairon mein sab se zyada sach kalaam Labeed ka ye kalaam hai ke: Khabardaar Allah ke ilawa har cheez laghw hai. Aur Abu Salt ka beta Umayya Islam ke qareeb tha, kyunke us ke aqaaid achay thay go wo Islam se mehroom raha. (Muslim: 7/49). Baab: Shair se pait bharnay ki karahat."
"1508","[AI-translation] Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar kisi mard ka pait peep se bharay, yahan tak ke us ke phephray tak pahunchay to ye us ke haq mein shairon se apna pait bharnay se behtar hai. Yani ashaar mein itna masroof ho jana ke Quran o hadees o uloom-e-deeniya se ghafil ho jaye. (Muslim: 7/50). Baab: Maddahon ke munh mein mitti daalna."
"1509","[AI-translation] Hammaam bin Haris se riwayat hai ke aik shakhs Usman (raziyallahu anhu) ki tareef karnay laga. Miqdad (raziyallahu anhu) apne ghutnon ke bal baithay, aur wo aik motay aadmi thay aur tareef karnay walay ke munh mein kankariyan daalnay lagay. Usman (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae Miqdad! Tumhein kya hua? Wo bolay ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya hai ke jab tum tareef karnay walon ko dekho to un ke munh mein khaak daal do. (Muslim: 8/228)"
"1510","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saamnay aik shakhs ka zikr aaya to aik shakhs bola ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Allah ke Rasool ke baad koi shakhs falan falan kaam mein us shakhs se behtar nahi. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke haaye tu ne apne saahib ki gardan kaat li, kai baar aisa hi farmaya. Phir farmaya ke agar tum mein se koi apne bhai ki tareef karna zaroori samjhay, agar wo waqai aisa ho, to yun kahay ke main khayal karta hun ke wo aisa hai, us par bhi main Allah ke saamnay kisi ko acha nahi kehta, yani maloom nahi ke wo Allah ke nazdeek kya hai kyunke ye ilm Allah ke siwa kisi ko nahi ya jis ko Allah bataye. (Muslim: 8/227-228). Baab: Chauser khelnay ke baaray mein."
"1511","[AI-translation] Buraida (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs chauser kheela us ne goya apne haath sooar ke gosht aur sooar ke khoon se rangay. (Muslim: 7/50). (Nard sheer se murad chauser hai; shatranj wali hadees sahih nahi.)"
